    "author": "塞壬唱片",
    "content": "<p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"05dcb3c0e1c684c8be9fc2a396eb3075\" title=\"图片.png\" alt=\"图片.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/siren/pic/20220215/05dcb3c0e1c684c8be9fc2a396eb3075.png\"/></div><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">假若阴云中缺少一枚太阳，</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">还请掬一捧河面的粼光。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">《Spark for Dream》，怀揣希望，抱持梦想，</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">Even if I’m on my own.</span></p><p><br/> </p>",
    "date": "2022-02-15"
  }
